=== four-state, event-driven
bare if: out is unknown
if/else: out = 238
=== two-state, every register starts at zero
bare if: out = 2
if/else: out = 2
=== two-state, randomized, three seeds
seed 1   bare if: out = 240 if/else: out = 240
seed 7   bare if: out = 169 if/else: out = 169
seed 99  bare if: out = 126 if/else: out = 126
the result changes with the seed: the missing reset is visible here too
